WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.102
-As the world comes together
to condemn Putin's invasion

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:04.804
of Ukraine,
some are asking what more

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.071
the U.S. can do to stop him.

00:00:06.071 --> 00:00:07.273
Here to discuss, please welcome

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:10.143
Republican strategist
Charles Reinke, everyone.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:15.982
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.884
-Ah, thanks for having me, Seth.

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.018
-Thanks for being here.

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:20.786
How many times have you been
on the show now?

00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:22.689
-I have lost count.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:25.257
I'd say somewhere
between 29 and 31.

00:00:25.257 --> 00:00:27.227
-So, 30?

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:28.695
-Yep, yeah.
-Okay, great.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:31.998
Now, when Russia invaded
Ukraine, quite a few Republicans

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:34.099
were actually praising Putin.

00:00:34.099 --> 00:00:37.003
As a Republican yourself,
what do you think about that?

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:39.405
-It's always been my opinion
that anyone who ever said

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:42.508
something positive about Putin
should be ashamed.

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:44.176
Putin is a weak tyrant

00:00:44.176 --> 00:00:46.445
who doesn't deserve
anyone's respect.

00:00:46.445 --> 00:00:49.282
I would even go so far
as to say he's a moron.

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:50.783
-Now, see, that is interesting

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:54.554
because I'm pretty sure you've
said the exact opposite.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.289
-Nah, I don't think that's true.

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:59.458
-Well, it is.
You said it on this very show.

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:01.494
Let's take a look at the tape.

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:03.830
-In my opinion,
Putin is a strong leader

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.798
who deserves everyone's respect.

00:01:05.798 --> 00:01:09.002
I would even go so far
as to say he's a genius.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.836
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:14.140
Okay, Seth, that is --
that's really unfair.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.741
-What's unfair?
-Well, you bringing me

00:01:15.741 --> 00:01:19.179
on your show just to run an old
clip of me contradicting myself.

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:21.247
I hate "gotcha journalism."

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.481
It makes for a bad interview.

00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:24.517
And frankly,
you should be ashamed.

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:26.553
-Now, see, that's not
what you said

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:27.787
the last time
you were on the show.

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:29.455
Let's take a look at the tape.

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:32.291
-I love "gotcha journalism."

00:01:32.291 --> 00:01:33.792
It makes for
an exciting interview.

00:01:33.792 --> 00:01:36.028
And frankly, if you ever did it
on your show,

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:37.730
you should be proud.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.064
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.064 --> 00:01:41.700
Okay, alright. That -- I must
have said that years ago.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.602
-No, that was in February.

00:01:43.602 --> 00:01:45.671
-I wasn't on the show
in February.

00:01:45.671 --> 00:01:47.072
-Let's look at the tape.

00:01:47.072 --> 00:01:50.009
-Happy last day of
Black History Month 2022.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.311
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:54.581
-It was so weird
that you said that at the time.

00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:56.348
-Yeah, well, I'm just trying to
be woke,

00:01:56.348 --> 00:01:57.983
you know, like you, Seth.

00:01:57.983 --> 00:01:59.986
Wake up!

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.589
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:04.657
Is that what the kids
are saying now? Wake up?

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:06.025
-I don't know.
-Woke up?

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.994
-Yeah, okay.
-Seth, let's just get back to

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:09.762
talking about the issue at hand.
-I would love that.

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:11.563
Yeah, okay. Great.
-Putin invading Ukraine

00:02:11.563 --> 00:02:13.866
is a real crisis.
-Roll the tape!

00:02:13.866 --> 00:02:17.537
-Putin invading Ukraine
is a made-up crisis.

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:19.072
-Charles, are you doing

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:20.339
something different
with your hair?

00:02:20.339 --> 00:02:21.774
-I stopped dying it.

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.643
This is my natural hair color.

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:26.045
I hate hiding my true self.

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:28.414
-So you're back to hiding
your true self?

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:30.416
-Well, I'm trying to date again.

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:33.185
Don't tell my wife.
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:33.185 --> 00:02:36.956
Seth, you're taking everything
I say out of context.

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:40.259
For example, I think
the Marvel movies are boring

00:02:40.259 --> 00:02:42.061
and I hate them,
but I'm sure you could find

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.529
some vague generic clip

00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:46.032
that makes it seem like
I love those movies.

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:50.336
-Like this one?

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:55.441
-Avengers, assemble!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:58.477
Alright. This is a textbook
liberal hit job

00:02:58.477 --> 00:03:00.379
to destroy my reputation.
-Sure.

00:03:00.379 --> 00:03:01.547
-What are you going to do next?

00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:03.916
Find some obscure radio clip
from 10 years ago

00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:05.518
where I make
some crazy comment like,

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:08.488
"There should never be a Black
woman on the Supreme Court"?

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:10.656
-No, but I am going to play
the podcast you did for us

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:11.990
last time you were on the show.

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:14.627
-To answer your question,
I don't believe we should have

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:16.829
a Black woman
on the Supreme Court.

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:18.631
-My question was
boxers or briefs.

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:20.066
-Boxers.

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:25.137
Oh, and by the way, happy last
day of Black History Month 2022.

00:03:25.137 --> 00:03:27.407
Looks like you got me.
[ Chuckles ]

00:03:27.407 --> 00:03:29.242
You know what?
You know, I don't need this.

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:31.077
I'm never coming back
on this show.

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:33.079
-Well, you've said that before.
-No, I haven't.

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:34.147
-Roll it.

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:36.616
-I'm never coming back
on this show.

00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:38.818
I'm never coming back
on this show!

00:03:38.818 --> 00:03:41.054
I'm never coming back
on this show.

00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:43.389
I'm never coming back
on this show!

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:47.126
I'm never coming back
on this show.

00:03:47.192 --> 00:03:49.596
I'm never coming back
on this show.

00:03:49.596 --> 00:03:52.098
I'm never coming back
on this show!

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:54.567
I'm never coming back
on this show.

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:56.669
-Wait, was that last one me?

00:03:56.669 --> 00:04:00.038
-No, it was me when I dressed up
as you for Halloween.

00:04:00.038 --> 00:04:02.675
Happy Halloween 2021.

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:04.176
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.176 --> 00:04:05.878
-Charles Reinke, everyone!

